Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.18.91-rt97 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.18.91 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.18-rt
  Head SHA1: 2e97633e499b2290451e496c4b2cb7fa8c09a8f1


Or to build 3.18.91-rt97 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.18.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.18.91.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.18/patch-3.18.91-rt97.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
